{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_1001_p", "source_sha256": "635cf10407900129ebb685301abc213cd9b8d4c7a144f921d046af19c198b822", "ja": "ライブお疲れさま、志保！\nどうしたんだ？　難しい顔して……。", "zh": "演唱会辛苦了，志保！\n怎么回事？露出这么严肃的表情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "7a77259108ee21180912787495c6ccae94aa22599749f8b989bdce21d7118296", "ja": "歌詞を……一ヶ所、間違えてしまいました。\nあんな初歩的なミスをするなんて……。", "zh": "我有一个地方……唱错词了。\n我竟然犯了这么基本的错误……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_1003_p", "source_sha256": "509caae6e75d23da346410c6e0d4d6543dade3adc46e58f8440746557f726269", "ja": "でも、その後ちゃんとフォローできてたし。\nそんなに気にしなくても大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "不过，之后有成功弥补了啊，\n你不用这么介意啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "98cafcc1b7a4dc01fa9ca9b964f0d9c560fd83a923ab3b73ab5def4cfd07e4ca", "ja": "いいえ。たとえ1回でも、本番でミスをしたことが\n問題なんです。", "zh": "不，就算只有一次，\n在正式演出犯错就是个问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "9bde5fc2c198d0ec2034e0a0afa2186057bcea4f2d2824d6482f16f0d0f83d75", "ja": "同じミスを繰り返さないように、練習しなくちゃ。\n{$P$}さんも付き合ってください。", "zh": "为了不重蹈覆彻，我得练习才行。\n{$P$}先生，请你陪我练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
